{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1051056-going-loud-demon-form","id":1051056,"title":"Going Loud: Demon Form","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-18T10:35:46-08:00","id":1051056,"title":"Going Loud: Demon Form","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> I have a rather simple question, hopefully the answer will be simple as well. If a Demon's true form is completely made of fire, does his form do damage to his surroundings if he were to go loud?<br /> <br /> Thanks,<br /> KF","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4812-karhu_fueryon","name":"karhu_fueryon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4812_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T18:17:28-08:00","id":1051260,"title":"","content":"Being made of actual, behaves-like-real-fire fire would be represented by possessing a corresponding demonic form ability, such as the Mantle of Fire Technology from the Player's Guide. Without some kind of form ability to represent it, you could be made of some supernatural kind of body-fire, but generally should stick to effects that are equivalent to reskinning something like a human body.<br /> <br /> With some form ability like Mantle of Fire, then yes, you would be able to ignite your surroundings or damage by sheer touch as per the form ability whenever you have it manifested, whether you're partially manifesting only Mantle of Fire, adopting demonic form normally, or going loud, which is a specific type of demonic form &quot;overdrive&quot; transformation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":